---
description: Global tech stack and core project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use Next.js (App Router), React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.
- Use Shadcn UI for base components and Framer Motion for micro-interactions.
- State management: Use Zustand for global client state (Cart, Wishlist) and React Query/SWR for server state caching.
- Strictly type everything. Avoid using `any`. Use Zod for schema validation on all forms and API inputs.
- Always implement loading skeletons (not spinners) for a premium feel while data fetches.
- Never modify generated files in `dist/` or `.next/`.